Hydrogen 1.2.7 reference runtime: licence and corresponding source

Hydrogen-1.2.7-x86_64.AppImage in this directory is the unmodified upstream
release asset of Hydrogen 1.2.7 (GitHub release 1.2.7; 85973496
bytes, sha256 4fa9e8e2f506f8380fc0b511a36c4ae72cbe0dc8b0ecd0fc0f7518443750b1bf).
solve.sh checks that digest and unpacks the image with the AppImage's own
extractor (--appimage-extract) into runtime/; no file content of the image is
changed. The launcher launch.py, start.sh and solve.sh are this
repository's own files and are not part of Hydrogen. launch.py only
seeds the product's settings file on first start (the product defaults with
OSC enabled, autosave off and the mixer window closed) and runs the product's
own programs (hydrogen, h2cli).

