The image also carries the factory drumkits GMRockKit and TR808EmulationKit,
demo songs and documentation (usr/share/hydrogen/data; their licences are
named in the drumkit and song files) and third-party shared libraries that
keep their own licences: Qt 5.15.2 (LGPL-3.0 / GPL), liblo, libsndfile,
libsamplerate, libmp3lame, libmpg123 and libpulse (LGPL-2.1), librubberband
(GPL-2.0-or-later), libarchive, FLAC, Ogg, Vorbis and Opus (BSD-style),
PortAudio and PortMidi (MIT-style), FFTW (GPL-2.0-or-later), ICU, OpenSSL 1.1
and further libraries of Ubuntu 20.04, whose copyright files are in
usr/share/doc of the unpacked image.

